[[File:Cards_Button.png|frameless|left]]
Cards are unlocked at Obelisk Level 15 and give perks according to the type of card.

There is a card for every ore, bar, bomb, [[Drones|drone]], [[Construct#Veins|vein]], [[Pets|pet]], [[Stargazing|star]], [[Archaeology|block]] and [[Fishing|fish]] in the game.
{{Clear|left}}

==How to get cards== 
Cards for resources (ores, bars, veins, stars, fish) are obtained by collecting the resource. For example, ore cards are obtained by mining ores, and star cards are obtained by catching stars. Other cards are obtained generally by interacting with the thing the card is for: Bomb cards are obtained by firing [[bombs]], Drone cards are obtained when the drone consumes [[Drones#Drone Fuel|drone fuel]] time, Pet cards are obtained by leveling [[pets]], and Archaeology block cards are obtained by breaking those blocks. Bar cards can be obtained either by crafting bars, or by getting them via the [[Bombs#tabber-Transmuter_Bomb|Transmuter Bomb]]. Legendary Fish cards are guaranteed upon catching the [[Fishing#Legendary_Fish|Legendary Fish]]. Misc cards are obtained by performing miscellaneous actions. See [[Cards#Misc card odds|below]].

Card odds are additive within an action. That is, if one action should roll for a card multiple times, the probability is added as many time as necessary. For example, if an ore has a 1/5,000,000 chance to give a card when mined, and you gain 50 ore from mining an ore on a rainbow floor, you roll a 50/5,000,000 chance to get the card, rather than rolling a 1/5,000,000 chance 50 separate times.

===Gilded Cards===
As soon as you unlock a standard card, you can gild it to increase its effect. Gilding it costs Prestige Points, Gold and Gems. See [[Cards#Gilded Card Costs]] for specific prices. Gilded Cards count as a new card in the [[Stats|Stats]] menu and for bonuses based on number of Cards owned.

===Polychrome Cards===
You can Polychrome your Cards after buying "[[Skill-Tree#Skills|This Is Gonna Take A While..]]" for 40 skill points in the [[Skill-Tree]] and then collecting 10 Polychrome Shards. Polychrome Shards are earned the same way as Cards. To earn Polychrome Shards for a Card, the Card needs to be Gilded first. Polychromed Cards also count as a new Card in the [[Stats|Stats]] menu and for bonuses based on number of Cards owned. The table shows base bonuses and maximally upgraded bonuses where applicable.

===Infernal Cards===
You can Ignite your Cards into Infernal Cards. You have to unlock each set individually. Once a set is unlocked, similar to Polychrome Cards, you must collect 10 Infernal Shards. Infernal cards also count as a new Card in the [[Stats|Stats]] menu and for bonuses based on number of Cards owned. Certain card sets require [[Skill-Tree|specific skills]] to unlock like [[Skill-Tree#FlamingVeins|Flaming Veins]] to unlock Infernal Vein Cards or [[Skill-Tree#AstralForge|Astral Forge]] to unlock Infernal Star Cards. Infernal Card effects scale based on the total number of Infernal Cards owned and the number of Infernal Cards owned in the same set.

