====Infernal Cards Multiplier====
The Infernal card multiplier (with the exception of legendary fish cards) is calculated by following formula:

<math>\text{Total Multiplier} = 1 + [(\text{PolyBonus} - 1) \times \text{InfernalBonus}]</math>

For example: If polychrome bonus is 15.54x and Infernal bonus is 8.92x, then total multiplier will be 130.70x.

