==Pet card odds==
Pet cards are rolled for when the pet levels. There is a <math>1/(12-\text{petLevel})</math> chance to get the card. If the pet reaches the max level before you get the card, you continue to roll for the card at the chance for the pet's next level. You can see this chance on the pet in the Pets menu. The chance to get a Polychrome Shard when a pet levels is 100%, however Infernal Shards are rolled completely separately to levels and levelling does not give an Infernal Shard. Refer to [[Pets#Leveling]] for pet level chances.

==Misc card odds==
{{See also|Guides/Cards}}
Misc cards are unlocked randomly when performing specific action or meeting specific condition. Note that except the CODE card/Polychrome shards and RELIC Polychrome shards, none of the misc cards are guaranteed to be unlocked and obtaining them is chance based. Some of the [[Cards#tabber-Infernal|infernal misc cards]] have different unlocking methods for shards compared to their standard and polychrome variants which is denoted by a 🔥.

